      "releaseNotes": "Capture the feeling of speed with our new Motion Blur tool. Turn everyday photos into dynamic moments with effortless control:\n\n• Instant motion presets: Automatically isolate your subject or background to simulate professional panning photography and high-speed motion in seconds.\n\n• Directional precision and subregions: Adjust blur along any angle, customize speed and acceleration, or add subregions directly onto your image to fine-tune the effect exactly where you need it.\n\nset your moments in motion,\nteam snapseed",
